## Assignment 2 Instructions
__________________________________________________________________
These are the following commands I used to help test my code:

- To run the sbatch, use... 'sbatch --partition=Centaurus part#_#.sbatch'
  - Example: sbatch --partition=Centaurus parta_1.sbatch
- To check and see if the sbatch is still running, run... 'squeue -j #####'
  - Example: squeue -j 25571

- I also used this command once I put my code into folders: sbatch --partition=Centaurus include/part#_#.sbatch
  - Example: sbatch --partition=Centaurus include/partb_2.sbatch